# QC scratch from the video pipeline — frame grabs and probe output the
# video-producer writes while checking a cut. Regenerates trivially from the
# hosted clips; the reviewable artifacts are the .md files and the final MP4.
projects/*/work/qc/

# Intermediate cuts. Each project commits ONE final upload file; the
# pre-end-card assembly and the native-resolution master before upscaling are
# both recorded as hosted URLs in the project's deliverables.md.
projects/*/*-noendcard-*.mp4
projects/*/*-final-9x16.mp4
